## Body

**One of: OrganizationEnterpriseLoginRequest**

<ParamField body="invitationToken" type={"string"}>

</ParamField>

<ParamField body="organizationId" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

<ParamField body="returnTo" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

**One of: InvitationEnterpriseLoginRequest**

<ParamField body="invitationToken" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

<ParamField body="returnTo" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

**One of: RetryEnterpriseLoginRequest**

<ParamField body="retryToken" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>


## Returns

**`200`** Company SSO URL when the target has a ready connection, otherwise the ordinary Account login URL. The response never says which, and access is decided only after authentication. StartEnterpriseLoginResponse

<ResponseField name="url" type={"string (uri)"} required>

</ResponseField>

